{"nodes": [{"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_skill_onp_spec_driven", "label": "onp-spec-driven (variante Codex)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Vitor Manoel \u2014 O Novo Programador", "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_skill_spec_anchored", "label": "Desenvolvimento spec-anchored", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Ferramentas spec-first geram c\u00f3digo a partir da spec; o c\u00f3digo evolui e a spec vira mentira. Spec-anchored inverte: a spec \u00e9 auditada mecanicamente contra o c\u00f3digo o tempo todo, e a prova \u00e9 o exit code do audit, n\u00e3o a palavra do agente.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/SKILL.md", "source_location": "linhas 13-23", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Vitor Manoel \u2014 O Novo Programador", "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_skill_motor_embarcado", "label": "Motor embarcado onp-spec.mjs", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Mora dentro da skill e \u00e9 resolvido relativo ao diret\u00f3rio da SKILL.md para eliminar instala\u00e7\u00e3o (sem npm/npx/CLI global) e evitar caminhos fixos de instala\u00e7\u00e3o. Sem node no ambiente, a auditoria manual deve ser rotulada PROVA FRACA.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/SKILL.md", "source_location": "linhas 82-109", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Vitor Manoel \u2014 O Novo Programador", "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_skill_contrato_de_execucao", "label": "Contrato de execu\u00e7\u00e3o inegoci\u00e1vel", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Seis regras que impedem o agente de declarar vit\u00f3ria: teste anotado @spec:AC-xxx obrigat\u00f3rio, o test runner decide, audit --ci exit 0 fecha a feature, suposi\u00e7\u00f5es/perguntas obrigat\u00f3rias, a constitui\u00e7\u00e3o manda, e nunca enfraquecer teste para passar \u2014 inclusive dentro de /goal.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/SKILL.md", "source_location": "linhas 111-132", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Vitor Manoel \u2014 O Novo Programador", "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_skill_plano_de_execucao", "label": "Plano de execu\u00e7\u00e3o com paralelismo opcional", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Agrupa tarefas de arquivos disjuntos em faixas (1 faixa = 1 git worktree + 1 branch + 1 janela de contexto limpa). QUAIS tarefas paralelizar e QUAIS modelos/esfor\u00e7os usar s\u00e3o escolha do usu\u00e1rio porque os tokens e a licen\u00e7a s\u00e3o dele; sem confirma\u00e7\u00e3o, n\u00e3o executa.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/SKILL.md", "source_location": "linhas 196-259", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Vitor Manoel \u2014 O Novo Programador", "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_skill_auto_dimensionamento", "label": "Auto-dimensionamento das fases", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Escopo pequeno pula Projetar/Tarefas/Plano; grande usa todas. Especificar e Auditar s\u00e3o sempre obrigat\u00f3rios. V\u00e1lvula de seguran\u00e7a: se ao executar aparecerem >5 passos ou depend\u00eancias, a fase Tarefas foi pulada por engano.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/SKILL.md", "source_location": "linhas 134-145", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Vitor Manoel \u2014 O Novo Programador", "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_skill_catalogo_de_problemas", "label": "Cat\u00e1logo de problemas do audit", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Cada problema tem nome leg\u00edvel (para o usu\u00e1rio) e c\u00f3digo est\u00e1vel entre par\u00eanteses (para CI e para licoes add --sinal). AC_SEM_TESTE, AC_SEM_PROVA, TESTE_ORFAO, REF_QUEBRADA, PRINCIPIO_VIOLADO, ARQUIVO_ORFAO, PROVA_FRACA etc.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/SKILL.md", "source_location": "linhas 306-337", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Vitor Manoel \u2014 O Novo Programador", "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_skill_codigos_de_rastreio", "label": "C\u00f3digos de rastreio US/AC/T/ASM/Q/P", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Os c\u00f3digos existem para a m\u00e1quina ligar spec, tarefas e testes. Com o usu\u00e1rio fala-se sempre o nome por extenso (hist\u00f3ria de usu\u00e1rio, crit\u00e9rio de aceite...), com o c\u00f3digo entre par\u00eanteses \u2014 nunca exigir que o usu\u00e1rio conhe\u00e7a as siglas.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/SKILL.md", "source_location": "linhas 25-43", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Vitor Manoel \u2014 O Novo Programador", "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_skill_degradacao_graciosa", "label": "Degrada\u00e7\u00e3o graciosa sem node", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Sem node, a auditoria vira manual e DEVE ser rotulada textualmente como PROVA FRACA (auditoria manual) \u2014 nunca apresentada como se fosse o gate mec\u00e2nico.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/SKILL.md", "source_location": "linhas 105-109", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Vitor Manoel \u2014 O Novo Programador", "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_skill_onp_spec_driven", "target": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_skill_spec_anchored", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_skill_onp_spec_driven", "target": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_skill_motor_embarcado", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}